# Defender prevents attacking until a Merfolk pays for permission; that permission ends at cleanup (CR 702.3, 611.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Vodalian War Machine
Mox Sapphire
Merfolk of the Pearl Trident
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
